+ * A cosmopolitan program reaches the WHP DLLs with cosmo_dlopen(). The entry
+ * points are called through cosmo_dltramp(), which adapts them to the System V
+ * convention used here (WINAPI is empty in the compat headers), while the
+ * callbacks handed to WinHvEmulation stay CALLBACK (Microsoft x64) because
+ * Windows is the caller.
